WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.743
When a crew works on the same
machine, use group lockout.

2
00:00:03.743 --> 00:00:06.764
One authorized employee
locks out the machine,

3
00:00:06.764 --> 00:00:10.638
verifies zero energy, and puts
the keys in a group lockbox.

4
00:00:10.638 --> 00:00:14.446
Then every worker adds their
own personal lock to the box.

5
00:00:14.446 --> 00:00:17.270
No one is protected by
someone else's lock.

6
00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:18.321
At shift change,

7
00:00:18.321 --> 00:00:23.640
the incoming worker applies their lock
before the outgoing worker removes theirs,

8
00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:26.331
so the machine is never left unprotected.
